OL,3,GNEWSAFamous 'This Is Anfield' sign
OL,4,Acould fetch #15k at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original "This Is Anfield" sign
OL,7,Ffrom Liverpool's stadium tunnel could
OL,8,Ffetch up to #15,000 at auction.
OL,10,FThe words famously hang above the
OL,11,Fpassage to the pitch and Reds players
OL,12,Ftraditionally touch the sign before
OL,13,Fmatches as they pass.
OL,15,FAuctioneer Budds said legendary manager
OL,16,FBill Shankly chose them in 1972 after
OL,17,Frejecting "Welcome To Anfield" as too
OL,18,Ffriendly.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
